- op: discuss  # 49c6
  at: '2026-04-09T11:20:13Z'  # 49c6
  by: agent  # 49c6
  actor: jgstern_agent  # 49c6
  clock: 3  # 49c6
  nonce: 49c6  # 49c6
  message: "Structural fix: smart-test flock guard (PR #2833) makes concurrent smart-test invocations structurally impossible. Second invocation exits immediately with PID of holder. The flock is OS-managed (auto-releases on crash). This addresses the highest-leverage causal factor (#2: no pre-launch idempotency check). Remaining causal factors (#1 stop-hook pressure, #3 TaskList not habituated) are softer — they reduce risk but don't gate the invariant. Moving to pending_validation — the next time an agent session runs a background test, the flock should prevent any duplicate launch."  # 49c6
