  clock: 5  # edac
  nonce: edac  # edac
  message: "Satisfied. Structural fix: smart-test flock guard (PR #2833) makes concurrent invocations structurally impossible. Verified manually: second invocation exits immediately with 'ERROR: Another smart-test is already running (PID N)'. The OS-managed file-descriptor lock auto-releases on crash (kill -9). This was also exercised during this session — multiple test runs completed without incident, and the lock was never stale."  # edac
